<title>HUNGARY: C.Europe's CESI index plummets to 1,359.27 points.</title>
<headline>C.Europe's CESI index plummets to 1,359.27 points.</headline>
<dateline>BUDAPEST 1996-11-13</dateline>
<text>
<p>The CESI Central European Share Index plunged on Wednesday to close at 1,359.27 points, down 20.22 points or 1.47 percent, the Budapest Stock Stock Exchange said.</p>
<p>The index, which has been published since February 1, reflect trends of 73 shares on the Budapest, Prague, Warsaw, Bratislava and Ljubljana bourses.</p>
<p>-- Budapest newsroom (36 1) 327-4040</p>
